{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vfs3P95ycy1793057032.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>李寧公布上季零售流水表現，不包括李寧YOUNG的銷售點，第三季零售流水錄得低單位數跌幅，當中線下渠道下跌中單位數，電子商務虛擬店舖則增長高單位數。</p><p></p><p>另外，集團表示下月5日將舉行董事會，考慮及批准派特別股息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:31.030590+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:33.560363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:18:16.889809+00:00","content_hash":"cea3f1fe8542b3dbb69d3fb6ea046c194786278057191aac1fe7897462a5f9f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T00:21:31.030590+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}